<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>燥症门 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%87%A5%E7%97%87%E9%97%A8/</link><description>Recent content in 燥症门 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 16:30:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%87%A5%E7%97%87%E9%97%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>燥症门</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-6-zaozhenmen/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 16:25:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-6-zaozhenmen/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“燥症门”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论&lt;strong&gt;血燥肺干、阴亏津涸&lt;/strong&gt;所致的痈疽、口舌燥裂、便血、肠结、小便不通、肺痿、风动、郁证、吐白血、羸瘦、惊疝、咳嗽脓血、产后诸燥症等危重症的辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;燥证皆由精血亏耗、阴津枯涸所致，当以滋肾润肺、补血养阴为根本，佐以清火、利水、润肠、平肝等法，不可妄用攻伐。诸症虽危，若能从本论治，补其真阴，则燥自润而生机可复&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>